WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.580
- Most people think of Hell
as a place where bad people go

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:05.193
and it just gets worse for them.

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:07.850
I'd like to think of Hell
as where bad people go

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:10.600
and everyone that does bad
things meets each other.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.589
And they can talk it out,
kinda like a therapy group.

00:00:13.589 --> 00:00:16.339
(dramatic music)

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.010
I think, right now I'm at a stage

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:24.990
where I'm kind of confused with religion.

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:26.370
- Religion matters to me.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:28.850
Cause if people don't believe in God,

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.913
then they won't go to Heaven.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:33.423
And it's better to be in Heaven than Hell.

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:37.973
- That's a good question.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.840
It's just a big part of
my life, I don't know.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.680
- If you did bad sins in your life

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:45.750
and never ask for forgiveness,

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.320
you go to Hell where you're punished

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.223
for when you're dead.

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:55.310
- Most people who do bad things

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.890
are also not very mentally stable

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:59.450
and that's not always their fault.

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:02.093
- If people kill people, I
think they'll go to Hell.

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:07.543
- Okay.

00:01:07.543 --> 00:01:10.810
I'm gonna kind of base it
off the Nether in Minecraft.

00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:12.100
Take a portal to go there

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:14.010
and there's a lot of bad creatures.

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:15.523
- I think cats are evil.

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:17.870
Hell might be full of cats.

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:19.400
- And there's fire everywhere

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.580
and it's all red and orange and yellow.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.350
- I think the Devil or Jesus
decides if you go to Hell.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:27.980
- I don't think of it as like
a Devil or you're on fire.

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.393
It could just be like you're
asleep and you never come up.

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:33.000
I mean, that could be what death is like.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.690
You're never gonna know
until you find out.

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:36.480
- I think Hell might be underground.

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:39.253
All red and dark volcanoes.

00:01:39.574 --> 00:01:41.250
- I almost don't wanna use red

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:44.483
because that's not really
how I want to think of Hell.

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:45.600
- Ooh, I found red!

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:47.863
- I imagine it's really hot.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:50.040
- I think it would be even hotter than LA.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.770
The Devil, see?

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:54.070
- In my religion, we call it Sheitan.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.963
- I think the volcanoes are
always erupting in Hell.

00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:59.410
- I imagine it's something
bad like carrying

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:03.200
a whole big wheelbarrow
full of heavy stuff.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.030
- I think people go to Hell forever.

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:06.510
- If you do bad things,

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:08.410
you go to Hell and there's not way out.

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:10.370
- After you go to Hell,

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:13.020
you can go to Heaven because
it's made you a better person.

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:15.120
It would make no sense to let these people

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:16.740
burn or be with the Devil.

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.990
I think it'd be cooler
if we could help them.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:19.923
- Meow.

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:23.313
- What's a politician?

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:26.190
- There's a person that should go to Hell.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:28.973
That person shall remain nameless.

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:33.240
Yeah. (laughs)

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:36.562
- This is just a devil cat, I guess.

00:02:36.562 --> 00:02:38.173
Like an evil cat.

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:42.840
- Maybe Hell is short
for help or helpfulness

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:45.930
and maybe someone said,
"Add an L instead of the P!"

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:47.060
And someone said, "Okay."

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:49.933
- There's a really bad red ground.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.570
There's a really, really bad evil person

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.950
having to pull a whole
load of heavy stuff.

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:57.483
Here's a Sheitan.

00:02:57.850 --> 00:02:59.530
- First you get this big blue arch

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:01.763
when you walk in and it says help is here.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.140
And this was a big sign that said Hell

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:05.853
in the original beginning,

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:08.460
but now it says help
because we've crossed it out

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:09.920
and that's how I think of Hell.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.060
Animal therapy.

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:13.170
We have our little taxi
that drove you here

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.900
with a very happy driver.

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:17.100
Food, where people go to socialize

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.190
and eat their healthy food

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:20.890
because health food makes you happier.

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:24.253
- This is all the lava,
the red stuff and the pink.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.710
The gray stuff is the
ground of the volcanoes.

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:28.610
- It's a really, really bad place

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:32.490
and I suggest you apologize
for every bad thing you've done

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:35.880
and never ever do anything
bad unless you want

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:39.220
to end up like this
really, really evil person.

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:40.577
- Think of if you have a loved one

00:03:40.577 --> 00:03:42.610
who did something very bad

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:44.970
or murdered someone and
you're watching this video.

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:47.030
This is how I want you
to think that they are.

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:49.943
If they've passed away, I
think they're getting help.

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:50.963
I'm not gonna lie.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.470
I don't know if this is real or not,

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:55.293
but if it is, I really
imagine this is what Hell is.

00:03:55.969 --> 00:03:58.552
(upbeat music)

